2. Third-party sources

   assets/assets.csv is derived from the Global Power Plant Database v1.3.0 by the World Resources
   Institute (Byers et al., 2018), released under CC BY 4.0
   (https://github.com/wri/global-power-plant-database). Any use must also credit the World Resources
   Institute. Plant and owner names have been removed.

   assets/country_points.csv uses label points from Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com),
   which is in the public domain.
